#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:255
#, php-format
msgid "Delete %s"
msgstr "Slett %s"

#. translators: 1: a few field names, e.g. "name, slug, parent"; 2: the name of the ability that describes every field.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:264
#, php-format
msgid "Fields include %1$s; %2$s gives every field."
msgstr "Feltene omfatter blant annet %1$s; %2$s oppgir alle feltene."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:270
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Lists the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s. `query` takes the "
"route's query parameters, e.g. search, page, per_page, and _fields to read "
"only some fields."
msgstr ""
"Lister opp butikkens %1$s via REST-ruten %2$s. `query` tar rutens "
"spørringsparametere, f.eks. search, page, per_page, og _fields for å lese "
"bare noen av feltene."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:272
#, php-format
msgid "Reads one of the store's %1$s by its id through the REST route %2$s."
msgstr "Leser en av butikkens %1$s ut fra id-en via REST-ruten %2$s."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:274
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creates one of the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s, with `fields` "
"as the route takes them."
msgstr ""
"Oppretter en ny blant butikkens %1$s via REST-ruten %2$s, med `fields` slik "
"ruten tar dem."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "shipping zone locations"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:277
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Replaces the %1$s through the REST route %2$s with `items`, the whole new "
"list: what it leaves out is removed."
msgstr ""
"Erstatter %1$s via REST-ruten %2$s med `items`, hele den nye listen: Det den "
"utelater, fjernes."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:279
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Changes one of the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s, with only the "
"`fields` to change."
msgstr ""
"Endrer en av butikkens %1$s via REST-ruten %2$s, med bare de `fields` som "
"skal endres."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:281
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Deletes one of the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s. With `force` it "
"is deleted for good where the route would otherwise move it to the trash."
msgstr ""
"Sletter en av butikkens %1$s via REST-ruten %2$s. Med `force` slettes den "
"permanent der ruten ellers ville flyttet den til papirkurven."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:284
msgid "The store downloads the file from `fields.source_url`, a public URL."
msgstr "Butikken laster ned filen fra `fields.source_url`, en offentlig URL."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:287
msgid ""
"Each also gives `pixonaut_setup`: the `blank_id` and `sides` (`key`, "
"`template_id`, `template_pinned`, `placement_id`, `label`, `mode`, and the "
"`value_set_id` and `values` the side is sold with, null for none, with "
"`values_from`: `own`, or `product` for a variation's product's) it is set up "
"with. Change it with `set-product-setup`, and the values with `set-product-"
"values`."
msgstr ""
"Hver oppgir også `pixonaut_setup`: `blank_id` og `sides` (`key`, "
"`template_id`, `template_pinned`, `placement_id`, `label`, `mode`, samt "
"`value_set_id` og `values` siden selges med, null hvis det ikke er noen, med "
"`values_from`: `own`, eller `product` for verdiene til en variants produkt) "
"den er satt opp med. Endre det med `set-product-setup` og verdiene med `set-"
"product-values`."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:290
msgid ""
"Each variation also gives `pixonaut_variant`, the variant of its blank it is "
"printed as: `ref` null and `problem` `unmapped` when it sells none, "
"`retired` when the blank no longer sells it, `picked` when the store manager "
"picked it rather than it being matched on the variation's attributes; null "
"when it is not personalised on a blank."
msgstr ""
"Hver variant oppgir også `pixonaut_variant`, basisproduktvarianten den "
"trykkes som: `ref` null og `problem` `unmapped` når den ikke selger noen, "
"`retired` når basisproduktet ikke lenger selger den, `picked` når "
"butikkadministratoren har valgt den i stedet for at den er matchet ut fra "
"attributtene til varianten; null når den ikke er personalisert på et "
"basisprodukt."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:290
msgid ""
"And `pixonaut_setup`: `own_setup` true when the variation has a Pixonaut "
"setup of its own, false when it follows its product; `blank_id` and `sides` "
"(`key`, `template_id`, `template_pinned`, `placement_id`, `label`, `mode`, "
"and the `value_set_id` and `values` the side is sold with, null for none, "
"with `values_from`: `own`, or `product` for a variation's product's) are "
"those it is sold under, its product's when it follows it. Change it with "
"`set-product-setup`, and the values with `set-product-values`."
msgstr ""
"Og `pixonaut_setup`: `own_setup` true når varianten har eget Pixonaut-"
"oppsett, false når den følger produktet sitt; `blank_id` og `sides` (`key`, "
"`template_id`, `template_pinned`, `placement_id`, `label`, `mode`, samt "
"`value_set_id` og `values` siden selges med, null hvis det ikke er noen, med "
"`values_from`: `own`, eller `product` for verdiene til en variants produkt) "
"er de den selges med, produktets når den følger det. Endre det med `set-"
"product-setup` og verdiene med `set-product-values`."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:308
msgid "The route's query parameters, e.g. search, page and per_page."
msgstr "Rutens spørringsparametere, f.eks. search, page og per_page."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:317
msgid "The whole new list."
msgstr "Hele den nye listen."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:329
msgid "The fields as the route takes them."
msgstr "Feltene slik ruten tar dem."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:330
msgid "Only the fields to change, as the route takes them."
msgstr "Bare feltene som skal endres, slik ruten tar dem."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:338
msgid "Delete it for good rather than move it to the trash."
msgstr "Slett permanent i stedet for å flytte til papirkurven."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:359
msgid "Dates and times are RFC 3339, with their offset."
msgstr "Datoer og klokkeslett oppgis etter RFC 3339, med tidsforskyvning."

#. translators: 1: a REST API route; 2: a sentence on how dates are written.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:364
#, php-format
msgid "What the REST route %1$s answers, without its links. %2$s"
msgstr "Hva REST-ruten %1$s svarer, uten lenkene. %2$s"

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:443
msgid ""
"Each also gives `pixonaut_validity`: `valid` false when its Pixonaut setup "
"has a problem and it cannot be bought until it is fixed, with the `reason` "
"as a code and the `message` the product screen shows for it, both null when "
"valid."
msgstr ""
"Hver oppgir også `pixonaut_validity`: `valid` false når Pixonaut-oppsettet "
"har et problem og den ikke kan kjøpes før det er rettet, med årsaken som "
"kode i `reason` og teksten som produktets redigeringsside viser for den, i "
"`message`; begge null når den er gyldig."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:477
msgid "The store refused it."
msgstr "Butikken avviste det."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:493
msgid "Give the file's public URL as fields.source_url."
msgstr "Oppgi filens offentlige URL som fields.source_url."

#. translators: %s: the largest file the store takes, e.g. "64 MB".
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:504
#: src/Catalogue/SplitCardImageCopies.php:271
