msgstr "Status"

#. translators: Heading of the shipment tracking links in the order details and shipping emails, shown to the shopper.
#: src/Labels.php:489
msgid "Tracking"
msgstr "Sporing"

#: src/Labels.php:493
msgid "Part of your order is on its way. The rest follows as soon as it ships."
msgstr "En del av ordren din er på vei. Resten kommer så snart den er sendt."

#: src/Labels.php:497
msgid ""
"There is new tracking for your order. Follow your parcel with the details "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Det er ny sporing for ordren din. Følg pakken din med opplysningene nedenfor."

#. translators: Under an item in the customer's email about a parcel that holds only some of the item's copies. 1: copies in this parcel, 2: copies ordered.
#: src/Labels.php:502
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d of %2$d in this parcel. The rest come in a separate parcel."
msgstr "%1$d av %2$d i denne pakken. Resten kommer i en egen pakke."

#. translators: Under an item in the customer's email about a parcel that holds some of the item's copies, when the printshop did not say how many.
#: src/Labels.php:507
msgid ""
"Part of this item is in this parcel. The rest come in a separate parcel."
msgstr ""
"En del av denne varen er i denne pakken. Resten kommer i en egen pakke."

#. translators: Under an item in the customer's email about the parcel that holds the last of the item's copies, the others having shipped before. 1: copies in this parcel, 2: copies ordered.
#: src/Labels.php:512
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d of %2$d in this parcel. The rest were sent in a separate parcel."
msgstr "%1$d av %2$d i denne pakken. Resten ble sendt i en egen pakke."

#. translators: Under an item in the customer's email about the parcel that holds the last of the item's copies, when the printshop did not say how many.
#: src/Labels.php:517
msgid ""
"Part of this item is in this parcel. The rest were sent in a separate parcel."
msgstr ""
"En del av denne varen er i denne pakken. Resten ble sendt i en egen pakke."

#. translators: Accessible name of the tabs that switch between a product's sides, such as front and back, on the product page, read by screen readers.
#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the product's sides, such as front and back, each with its template.
#: src/Labels.php:522 templates/admin/product-fields.php:174
msgid "Sides"
msgstr "Sider"

#: src/Labels.php:526
msgid ""
"Your order is paid. Before we print it, please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it. Nothing is printed until you do."
msgstr ""
"Ordren din er betalt. Før vi trykker, ber vi deg kontrollere korrekturen av "
"designet ditt og godkjenne den. Ingenting trykkes før du har gjort det."

#. translators: Link in the proof email to the shopper, and under the order item on the order received page and in My Account; opens the proof page where the design is approved.
#: src/Labels.php:531
msgid "Review and approve your design"
msgstr "Se gjennom og godkjenn designet ditt"

#: src/Labels.php:535
msgid "Thank you for approving your design. It is now on its way to print."
msgstr "Takk for at du godkjente designet ditt. Det er nå på vei til trykk."

#: src/Labels.php:539
msgid ""
"We are still waiting for your approval. Please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it, or tell us what to change. Nothing is printed until "
"you do."
msgstr ""
"Vi venter fortsatt på godkjenningen din. Kontroller korrekturen av designet "
"ditt og godkjenn den, eller fortell oss hva vi skal endre. Ingenting trykkes "
"før du har gjort det."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:544
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will print your design as the proof "
"shows it."
msgstr ""
"Hvis vi ikke har hørt fra deg innen %s, trykker vi designet ditt slik "
"korrekturen viser det."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:549
#, php-format
msgid "If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item."
msgstr "Hvis vi ikke har hørt fra deg innen %s, kansellerer vi denne varen."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:554
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item and refund it."
msgstr ""
"Hvis vi ikke har hørt fra deg innen %s, kansellerer vi denne varen og "
"refunderer den."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:559
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will not print your design and will "
"be in touch about this item."
msgstr ""
"Hvis vi ikke har hørt fra deg innen %s, trykker vi ikke designet ditt, og vi "
"tar kontakt med deg om denne varen."

#: src/Labels.php:563
msgid ""
"You did not approve your design by the deadline, so we have cancelled this "
"item. Nothing was printed."
msgstr ""
"Du godkjente ikke designet ditt innen fristen, så vi har kansellert denne "
"varen. Ingenting ble trykket."

#: src/Labels.php:567
msgid "Its price is being refunded to you."
msgstr "Beløpet for varen blir refundert til deg."

#. translators: Button on the product page opened to edit a cart item, shown to the shopper; saves the changed design.
#: src/Labels.php:572
msgid "Update design"
msgstr "Oppdater design"

#: src/Labels.php:576
msgid "This design was changed elsewhere. Please reload the page."
msgstr "Dette designet ble endret et annet sted. Last inn siden på nytt."

#: src/Labels.php:580
msgid "This design can no longer be changed."
msgstr "Dette designet kan ikke lenger endres."

#: src/Labels.php:584
msgid "This item is no longer in your cart."
msgstr "Denne varen ligger ikke lenger i handlekurven din."

#. translators: Button on the product page, shown to the shopper; opens the Pixonaut designer to personalise the product.
#: src/Labels.php:589
msgctxt "verb: button that opens the designer"
msgid "Personalise"
msgstr "Personaliser"

#: src/Labels.php:593
msgid ""
"We could not match your design to this visit. Please personalise the product "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Vi kunne ikke knytte designet ditt til dette besøket. Personaliser produktet "
