#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:719
msgid ""
"Warnings in a product’s Pixonaut tab about images in its template that print "
"below the resolution Pixonaut recommends at one of its print sizes."
msgstr ""
"Varsler i et produkts Pixonaut-fane om bilder i malen som trykkes under "
"oppløsningen Pixonaut anbefaler, i en av produktets trykkstørrelser."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: how customers approve their design before it is printed.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing how customers approve their design (proof) before printing. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:725 templates/admin/product-fields.php:249
msgid "Approval"
msgstr "Godkjenning"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:726
msgid ""
"How customers approve their design before it is printed. A product’s "
"Pixonaut tab can choose another way for that product."
msgstr ""
"Hvordan kunder godkjenner designet sitt før det trykkes. Pixonaut-fanen til "
"et produkt kan velge en annen måte for akkurat det produktet."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the approval mode where customers approve a proof sent by email.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:732
msgid "Proof by email"
msgstr "Korrektur på e-post"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:733
msgid ""
"For every product whose approval is Proof by email: how long customers have "
"to answer, the reminders they get, and what happens when they do not approve."
msgstr ""
"For hvert produkt med godkjenningen Korrektur på e-post: hvor lenge kundene "
"har på seg til å svare, påminnelsene de får, og hva som skjer når de ikke "
"godkjenner."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: the rule that prices products from what the printshop charges for them.
#. translators: Column of the Prices table of the product edit page: how the price stands to the pricing rule, and what the rule suggests.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:739 templates/admin/product-prices.php:100
#: templates/admin/product-prices.php:117
msgid "Pricing rule"
msgstr "Prisregel"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:740
msgid ""
"Prices a product from what the printshop charges for it. Apply the rule in a "
"product’s Pixonaut tab, under Prices; from then on its prices follow the "
"rule. A product can change any part of the rule for itself."
msgstr ""
"Prissetter et produkt ut fra hva trykkeriet tar for det. Bruk regelen i "
"produktets Pixonaut-fane, under Priser; deretter følger prisene til "
"produktet regelen. Et produkt kan endre hvilken som helst del av regelen for "
"seg selv."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: whether product pages say how long delivery takes.
#. translators: Label of a row of the product's attributes table: how long until the customer has the order, e.g. "5–8 days".
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:746 src/Storefront/DeliveryRows.php:202
msgid "Delivery time"
msgstr "Leveringstid"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:747
msgid ""
"A printshop tells how long a product takes to make and to deliver to your "
"shop’s country. Pixonaut reads it with the printshop’s cost."
msgstr ""
"Et trykkeri oppgir hvor lang tid et produkt tar å produsere og å levere til "
"butikkens land. Pixonaut henter det sammen med trykkeriets kostnad."

#. translators: Heading of a group of settings on the Pixonaut settings page, shown to the merchant: which releases of this plugin WordPress offers.
#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:753
msgid "Plugin updates"
msgstr "Oppdateringer av utvidelsen"

#: src/Settings/SettingsPage.php:754
msgid ""
