#: templates/admin/attribute-query-name-field.php:23
msgid "Name in addresses"
msgstr "Navn i nettadresser"

#. translators: Help under the "Name in addresses" field on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute. "?size=50x70-cm" is an example of a web address's query; keep it as it is.
#: templates/admin/attribute-query-name-field.php:25
msgid ""
"The name a product page's address and the shop's filters give this "
"attribute, as in ?size=50x70-cm: lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens or "
"underscores. Left empty, it goes by its slug."
msgstr ""
"Navnet en produktsides nettadresse og butikkens filtre gir dette "
"attributtet, som i ?size=50x70-cm: små bokstaver, tall og bindestreker eller "
"understreker. Står feltet tomt, brukes attributtets slug."

#. translators: %s: Why the name was refused. Shown under the "Name in addresses" field on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute, after the attribute was saved.
#: templates/admin/attribute-query-name-field.php:27
#, php-format
